{
    "$comment": [
        "The public export names of react-native, read from the installed package's index.js",
        "rather than from documentation. src/support-table.ts must have exactly these keys.",
        "SORTED, so a version bump diffs as the names that changed rather than as the order",
        "upstream happens to declare them in. The comparison is set-based either way.",
        "Committed rather than derived at check time because react-native pulls ~170 MB of",
        "dependencies (hermes-compiler alone is 47 MB) and every workspace install would pay it",
        "for one list of strings. scripts/check-rn-surface.mjs compares the table against this",
        "file always, and additionally re-derives this file from a real react-native install",
        "when one is resolvable -- so the gate is stronger where the package is present and says",
        "so where it is not. When the resolved version differs from the one recorded here, it",
        "reports the difference between the two releases rather than failing: they are two",
        "questions, and this file answers the one about the release this layer TRACKS."
    ],
    "reactNativeVersion": "0.86.3",
    "readOn": "2026-09-04",
